  "details": "1. Toggle the \"Roll While Flying\" option under the camera's \"Behavior\" menu to \"off\"\n\n2. Close and Reopen VRChat\n\n3. The option resets to \"on\"\n\nThe \"Trigger Takes Photo\" option will remember it's setting once you toggle it on/off, and I feel the \"Roll While Flying\" option should have a similar behavior, as this is something people may want to leave disabled indefinitely to avoid taking off-level photos.",
